<div id="faq" class="muqavi-faq-section section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
  <div class="page-width">
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <div class="muqavi-faq-header">
        <h2 class="muqavi-faq-title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="muqavi-faq-subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="muqavi-faq-accordion-wrap">
      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <details class="muqavi-faq-item" id="Details-{{ block.id }}-{{ section.id }}" {% if forloop.first and section.settings.open_first %}open{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <summary class="muqavi-faq-question">
              <span class="muqavi-faq-q-text">{{ block.settings.question | escape }}</span>
              <span class="muqavi-faq-icon">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="icon-line-v" x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                  <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="muqavi-faq-answer rte">
              {{ block.settings.answer }}
            </div>
          </details>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <!-- Fallback Default FAQs -->
        <details class="muqavi-faq-item" open>
          <summary class="muqavi-faq-question">
            <span class="muqavi-faq-q-text">What is Majoon-e-Muqavi and what are its benefits?</span>
            <span class="muqavi-faq-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line class="icon-line-v" x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="muqavi-faq-answer rte">
            <p>Majoon-e-Muqavi is a traditional Unani herbal formulation enriched with 45+ natural ingredients including Ashwagandha, Salab Panja, Ginseng, Saffron, and pure honey. It is specifically formulated to naturally support male vitality, physical stamina, strength, and overall vitality without synthetic chemicals.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="muqavi-faq-item">
          <summary class="muqavi-faq-question">
            <span class="muqavi-faq-q-text">Are there any side effects? Is it safe for daily use?</span>
            <span class="muqavi-faq-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line class="icon-line-v" x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="muqavi-faq-answer rte">
            <p>Yes, it is 100% natural and safe for daily use. It is certified by PCSIR (Pakistan Council of Scientific and Industrial Research) with zero steroids, zero chemicals, and no side effects.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="muqavi-faq-item">
          <summary class="muqavi-faq-question">
            <span class="muqavi-faq-q-text">How should I use Majoon-e-Muqavi for best results?</span>
            <span class="muqavi-faq-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line class="icon-line-v" x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="muqavi-faq-answer rte">
            <p>Take 1 teaspoon (approx. 5-7 grams) daily with lukewarm milk, preferably before sleep or after breakfast. Consistent use for 3 to 4 weeks is recommended for noticeable, lasting results.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="muqavi-faq-item">
          <summary class="muqavi-faq-question">
            <span class="muqavi-faq-q-text">How long does delivery take across Pakistan?</span>
            <span class="muqavi-faq-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line class="icon-line-v" x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="muqavi-faq-answer rte">
            <p>We deliver nationwide across Pakistan in 2 to 4 business days. All orders are shipped via Cash on Delivery (COD) in 100% discreet packaging to ensure complete privacy.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="muqavi-faq-item">
          <summary class="muqavi-faq-question">
            <span class="muqavi-faq-q-text">How can I track my order or contact customer support?</span>
            <span class="muqavi-faq-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line class="icon-line-v" x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="muqavi-faq-answer rte">
            <p>You can reach our dedicated support team via WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/923390091552" target="_blank">+92 339 0091552</a> or email us at <a href="mailto:support@muqaviherbsofficial.com">support@muqaviherbsofficial.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.show_faq_button -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign prod = all_products['majoon-e-muqavi']
        if section.settings.product != blank
          assign prod = section.settings.product
        endif
        assign buy_url = prod.url | default: '/products/majoon-e-muqavi'
      -%}
      <div class="muqavi-faq-cta">
        <a class="muqavi-faq-btn" href="{{ buy_url }}">{{ section.settings.button_label | default: 'Order Majoon-e-Muqavi' }}</a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{%- style -%}
  .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    }
  }

  .muqavi-faq-section {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-top: 1px solid #eef2ed;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-section .page-width {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.6rem;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 3.2vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f2613;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-subheading {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-accordion-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-item {
    background: #fbfdfa;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8e0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-item[open] {
    border-color: #c6983b;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(15, 38, 19, 0.05);
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-question {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.8rem 2.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    color: #0f2613;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-q-text {
    flex: 1;
    padding-right: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #edf3ec;
    color: #0f2613;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-item[open] .muqavi-faq-icon {
    background: #c6983b;
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .muqavi-faq-answer {
    padding: 0 2.2rem 2.2rem;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #374151;
    border-top: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-item[open] .muqavi-faq-answer {
    border-top-color: #f1f5f0;
    padding-top: 1.4rem;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-answer p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-answer p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-answer a {
    color: #194421;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 3.6rem;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 34px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffe2a0 0%, #fdd271 50%, #c6983b 100%);
    color: #0f2613;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(198, 152, 59, 0.25);
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .muqavi-faq-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(198, 152, 59, 0.35);
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Find answers to common questions about Majoon-e-Muqavi, usage, and orders."
